    "RotarySpeaker": {
      "description": "The Rotary Speaker block (Rotary A + Rotary B).\n\nBalance is a centred value (`0x40` = R=H — see [`balance_label`]); Stereo/Mono is typed. Speed / Acceleration / Transition stay raw `0..=127` indices: the manual documents only their rpm/ratio range + default (exposed via [`ROTARY_SPECS`]), and the device's per-step curve isn't published or derivable (Rotary A and B use different byte→rpm mappings), so no per-byte conversion is provided. Transition is itself a raw `0..=127` value.",
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "a_balance",
        "a_horn_acceleration",
        "a_horn_deceleration",
        "a_horn_fast",
        "a_horn_slow",
        "a_rotor_acceleration",
        "a_rotor_deceleration",
